{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;DeskAlchemy: Xiao Ke's Journey&quot;is an idle to light storyline role-playing game;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young man from a small town encounters a talking mole named Xiao Ke, and embarks on a journey to dig for minerals and treasure across the country.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle collection:</strong> In different scenarios, Xiao Ke will automatically enter the mine, dig for and sell minerals, and then exit the mine to rest, drink tea, and interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story line:</strong> As the game progresses, you will receive letters from your family members in the town, sharing your travels and experiences, receiving gifts, or completing tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tasks and Achievements:</strong> Dig for minerals and treasures, complete acquisition tasks in various locations, and fulfill achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure Gallery</strong>: 360-degree display of high-quality minerals and treasures (under development)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920980/extras/73e3c1a9663b8351b0c1e35c330dc432.poster.avif?t=1774607955\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920980/extras/73e3c1a9663b8351b0c1e35c330dc432.webm?t=1774607955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920980/extras/73e3c1a9663b8351b0c1e35c330dc432.mp4?t=1774607955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as